NC Digital builds fast, modern, SEO-focused websites for small businesses across Mid Wales — from Aberystwyth and Newtown to Welshpool, Brecon, and beyond. We design every website from scratch, built to generate enquiries.

> "A well-built website is your digital shopfront — it should be fast, clear, and designed to convert visitors into customers."

## Web design built for Mid Wales businesses

Businesses in Mid Wales often face a challenge: a smaller, more spread-out local customer base means your website needs to work harder to get found — and convert when visitors arrive.

We build websites with local search built in, combining strong service pages, location signals, and technical SEO so Mid Wales businesses get found. Pair your new site with our [Mid Wales SEO service](/seo-mid-wales/) to drive consistent Google traffic.

## What's included in our web design packages

Every Mid Wales web design project includes:

- Custom website optimised for speed, clarity, and conversions
- Mobile-first design tested across all devices
- On-page SEO targeting Mid Wales and surrounding areas
- Secure UK-based [hosting with SSL](/services/website-hosting-security/) and performance optimisation
- Full content management access — no locked templates
- Google Analytics setup
- Training so you can manage your own site

We also offer [website maintenance packages](/services/website-maintenance-packages/) and [local SEO for Mid Wales](/seo-mid-wales/) to keep your site growing after launch. For businesses looking to sell online, our [ecommerce web design for Mid Wales](/ecommerce-web-design-mid-wales/) service covers Shopify, WooCommerce, and SureCart builds.

## Why choose NC Digital?

- **Wales based** — we understand the Welsh market and regional search behaviour
- **Direct relationship** — you work with the developer, not an account manager
- **No fluff** — no agency layers, no unnecessary extras

## Areas we serve

[Aberystwyth](/web-design-aberystwyth/), [Newtown](/web-design-newtown/), [Welshpool](/web-design-welshpool/), [Llandrindod Wells](/web-design-llandrindod-wells/), [Brecon](/web-design-brecon/), [Machynlleth](/web-design-machynlleth/), [Builth Wells](/web-design-builth-wells/), [Hay-on-Wye](/web-design-hay-on-wye/), and across Mid Wales. We also cover [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and [North Wales](/web-design-north-wales/).

## Frequently asked questions

**Do you work in Mid Wales?**

Yes — we work with businesses across [all of Wales](/web-design-wales/) and the UK.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

